WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.800
Here is your report and
business letter of attorney.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:16.970
Good, send them with this message.

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:51.150
"Request"

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:53.610
How are things going on your side?
"Request"

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:53.690
"Request"

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:55.800
There appears to be a gag order in place.
"Request"

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.570
There appears to be a gag order in place.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:03.740
General staff hasn't been informed,
so business can continue as usual.

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:09.410
Just to be safe, increase surveillance
of the higher-ranking officials.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:12.380
We need to extinguish all extraneous noise

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:15.750
until I've seized the organization.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:20.680
What about the elimination
of the first-generation Sisters?

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:24.720
Yes. It will be completed shortly.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:29.060
I see. What a disappointment they are.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:33.860
Enter.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:42.110
You seem quite used to
the representative's chair already.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.990
You're really something!

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.580
I'd expect no less from
the latest and greatest Neo-Gene,

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:51.250
I suppose I should say.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.830
What do you want?

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:57.670
To say we've blamed Furumizu's
incident on an accidental explosion.

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:01.220
I see. Thank you.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:08.430
Now that I'm free of inane restrictions,
I can conduct perfect research!

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.770
I look forward to your results.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:20.240
You really are something...

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:32.660
What rubbish. This organization
serves no purpose for me.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:38.340
Yes...

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:42.260
The power to obtain everything...

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.180
It will be mine!

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:13.210
She's definitely skilled,
but she's also dangerous...

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:19.090
If I make the slightest blunder, I'll be next.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.680
Hello?

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:32.020
Oh, Director Wadou. Do you need something?

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:36.230
Don't give me that! Have you
not looked at the data I sent you?!

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:38.560
Data?

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:45.860
W-What is this?!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:50.870
Our Ultimate Blade was defeated all too easily!

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:56.620
I wasn't told the Witchblade
still had such powers!

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:03.340
Now that she's with Takayama,
who knows when she'll come for us!

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:06.300
Hey! Are you listening?!

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.510
Yes...

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:15.430
This will surely be our trump card!

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.520
Trump card?

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:20.230
We'll need to capture her right away.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:24.190
But that won't be possible
with just an Ultimate Blade.

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:27.780
I'm going to need some of Douji's technology.

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:34.580
Yes. That's right. Good.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:07.360
Are you really all right?

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.030
Eh?

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:12.700
That was a lot of power you used.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.790
I wouldn't be surprised if
it affected you somehow.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:21.750
Don't be silly! I'm just fine! See? A-OK!

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:27.010
In any case, you need to
avoid fighting from now on.

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:33.720
If you get hurt and shorten
your life span, Rihoko will be...

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:41.440
Hey, you've resolved yourself
to being her father, right?

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:42.440
Yeah.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:48.030
Then you and Rihoko need to bond,
even if it's little by little!

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:55.490
You're the only dad she
has in the world. Okay?

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.700
I know.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:04.290
Great! Then I have a proposition to make!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:14.760
So you, me, and Takayama-san
are all going out tomorrow!

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.470
Yay!

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:20.770
So you and Takayama-san made up, then?!

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:22.770
I guess you could say that!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:25.560
But are you sure you want me to come too?

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:26.650
Eh?

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:31.700
I mean, won't I get in you
guys' way if I'm with you?

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:35.950
O-Oh, you! Don't be like that!

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:39.660
You're such a grown-up kid!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:47.960
Yeesh. Looks like things've finally
calmed down as much as they can.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:56.010
I was going to run for the job
of Rihoko-Chan's dad! I'm so sad!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:08:02.310
I'm sad, but for their happiness,
my only choice is to drop out!

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:08.900
It's only natural. Besides, there's
a guy who has it even worse off.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:13.400
I'm too shady of a man  Huh?

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.910
W-What?

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.280
Let's drink, Tozawa-Chan!

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:23.540
Let's drink 'til morning
as fellow heartbreakees!

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:27.750
I'm telling you, it's nothing like that at all!

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.790
Happiness...

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:37.720
Even if it is far now,
it will eventually visit...

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.430
That is what I see.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.390
Mind your own business!

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:20.600
It's just you? Where's your mother?

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:24.390
She suddenly had work to do,

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:28.440
so she said for us to go on ahead.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.730
Work?

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:35.110
Here! This is from Mom!

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:41.910
"I'm going to let you and Rihoko
have time all to yourselves."

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:48.000
"Take her on the best
date ever! Good luck, Dad!"

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:53.500
What's wrong?

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.920
O-Oh, nothing.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:59.430
Did she say anything else?

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:01.430
She said to leave everything to you,

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:06.600
since you probably know
lots of great date spots!

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.440
What?!

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.380
Welcome!

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:58.490
What do you think, Takayama-san?

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:01.360
Yeah. It's good.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:08.290
Thank you very much!

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:11.040
"Wild Animal Zoo"

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.550
Have you decided?

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:05.720
N-Not yet!

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:09.430
What do I do? He's mad...

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:12.600
Please hurry here, Mom!

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:26.410
You left a bit on your plate...
Did it not suit your tastes?

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:30.540
N-No, it was very delicious...

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:31.950
Oh.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:38.170
Umm, is it boring not having my mom with us?

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:44.050
No, not at all. Why do you ask?

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:51.220
It's just, you've been scowling
all this time. You're angry, right?

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:55.020
Oh... No, I'm sorry.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:58.560
I'm, uhh, just nervous.

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:00.230
Eh?

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:07.860
The truth is, I'm not really sure
how to interact with children...

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:11.580
Oh, is that it? That's simple!

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:15.160
You just smile and say, "Nee!"

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.750
Nee...

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:22.340
No! Not like that! Like, "Nee!"

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.630
Nee...

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:26.930
Yeesh! That makes you look like a pervert!

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:30.010
Again! "Nee!"

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.640
Nee...

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:34.270
Nee!
Nee...

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:36.850
What are they doing?

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:42.150
I guess leaving them
alone was asking too much...

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.660
What's wrong?

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:53.490
Could you wait here for a moment?

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:54.490
Okay!

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.620
Oh, crap!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.710
And where are you going?

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.210
Eep!

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.710
Uhh, the bathroom?

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:09.130
You followed us around the whole time?

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:11.890
Come on, I was worried!

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:14.680
Seriously, now...
Oh, come on!

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:17.850
You were gonna have to
do it sometime anyway!

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:21.650
It was better to do it
sooner rather than later!

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:23.480
Yoohoo! Riko!

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:26.440
Oh! Mom! You're finished with work?

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:29.030
Yep! Thanks, Riko!

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:33.070
So, what did you think of Takayama-san?

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:35.830
Hmm, he's okay, I guess!

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:39.290
Yeah? That's great!

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:42.580
Okay, let's go someplace you want next!

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:45.710
Okay!

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:52.720
You chose another glum place, Riko.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:55.470
I've always wanted to try this!

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:59.390
You got one! You got one!

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:05.190
It took the bait...

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:07.110
Let me have that.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:11.860
There you go.

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:13.780
Thanks!

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:28.420
Alright! You better catch one, Riko!
I'm not gonna let you outdo me!

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:29.510
Okay!

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:32.130
Hey. You got one.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:35.430
Oh, I do! Uhh, umm, yaah!

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:38.770
Got away again... Hey, put bait on mine, too!

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.480
Do it yourself.

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:43.650
Eh?! How come?!

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:50.150
No, no! You gotta be more extravagant about it!

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:53.610
Mom! Don't be mean to Takayama-san!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:56.870
You spilled it all your first time, remember?

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:02.710
Eh? Whose side are you on, Riko?
You make me sad...

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:05.580
Okay! Here you are, Takayama-san!

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.460
Thank you.

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:13.380
What do you think?

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:16.260
Yes, it's quite good!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:18.300
That's great!

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:22.100
Thanks for the food!

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.230
That was delicious!

00:16:26.310 --> 00:16:29.820
I should've left you in
charge from the start, huh?

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.190
That's not true!

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:38.660
I felt all grown up at the restaurant
and on the boat! It was exciting!

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:41.910
Oh. That's good, then...

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.410
A goldfish shop!

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:49.460
Let's go! C'mon, c'mon!

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.550
Hey, now!

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:54.760
Look, look! They're so cute!

00:16:54.840 --> 00:17:00.300
Oh, that tiny one's cute,
but I like this chubby one, too!

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:14.240
So what are your thoughts after
spending a day with your daughter?

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:16.360
Don't tease me.

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:20.200
But I'm really relieved...

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:23.240
Things are still a little awkward,

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:28.210
but now I know I can leave Riko in your hands.

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:35.670
What is it?!

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:37.800
I sense something.

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:39.430
What?!

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:53.150
What was that?!
It's coming!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:02.200
Use the gun! In the glove compartment!

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.870
Mom!
Get down!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:06.500
What's going on?!
Now!

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:20.380
Masane!
Mom!

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:27.600
Mom!

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:35.270
I-I see... You want the Witchblade...

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.620
No!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:47.580
I can still fight!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.500
I won't...

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.130
I won't let you have Riko!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.160
I feel it...

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:39.670
This is... power.

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:44.840
The power to obtain anything...

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:46.720
...I desire!

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:55.150
That's not possible...

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:58.820
Exceeding the Ultimate Blade...

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.490
Mom?

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:22.090
Riko...

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:37.480
Mom!

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:42.900
Riko... You're not afraid?

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:45.200
No...

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:48.530
After all, you're my mom!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:58.630
Riko... You're so wonderful...

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:12.720
Please take care of Riko...

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.400
Mom?
Masane!

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:20.110
Mom!

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:24.570
Mom! Say something! Mom! Mom!

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.610
Damn it!

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:31.200
Mom!
Masane!

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:37.710
Mom! Say something! Mom!

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:54.740
I turn around half-asleep as my hits the right side of my cheek

00:21:54.740 --> 00:22:02.990
Your voice was there, and the air was warm

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:11.260
Your right hand grazes my left shoulder

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.730
But why don't you hold on tight?

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:28.500
In order to change yesterday's wish tomorrow,

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:35.690
I need to grow stronger myself

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:44.840
Even now, I am breathing in your scent, ...

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:53.510
and jumping over to your side. Give me your love.

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:02.990
Extend your hands. Reach them out to me.

00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:09.540
I'm so happy

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:18.560
I'm sorry, Mom. I had no
idea your work was that rough.

00:23:18.640 --> 00:23:22.100
Please don't work too hard anymore.

00:23:22.190 --> 00:23:23.560
Don't worry about money.

00:23:23.650 --> 00:23:29.190
Mariko-san is giving me half
the sales for food sold in her shop!

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:34.780
Let's save that money so we can
build our own house someday!

00:23:34.870 --> 00:23:39.040
So please get some rest, Mom.
